# foundation.fml — version routing and the planning horizon

"FC Actual IN" { Versions, YearMonth }
  @type integer
  @folder "Foundation"
  @notes "1 = this period of this version is closed and has payroll actuals; empty = plan. Writer: model administrator."

"FC Actual Flag" { Versions, YearMonth } = "FC Actual IN"
  @type integer
  @rollup average
  @folder "Foundation"
  @readonly true

"Planning Horizon IN" { Versions, YearMonth }
  @type integer
  @folder "Foundation"
  @notes "1 in every month of the planning horizon; the monthly carrier for position-level calculations. Writer: model administrator."
